      "id": "mem_mvh89vjk_bediar2n",
      "content": "The user's agent guidance lives in `~/agenticlibrary` (they may type it as \"agentLIbrary\"). Read `README.md` and `context.md` first, then recent `sessions/<date>-<topic>/session.md` logs for the class being worked on.\n\nKey rules from context.md: brief explanations, no em dashes in any output, response format of Approach / Code / Key decisions / Complexity / Edge cases / Key lessons, no tests unless asked. The README asks for a session log at the end of each session in `sessions/`.\n\n**Why:** The user asked to refer to it for guidance and context (2026-09-25).\n**How to apply:** Read it at the start of CSE4095 tasks and write a session log when done. Related: [[cse4095-notebook-workflow]]",
